*> PLB-C082 pointer-below-one: STRING or UNSTRING with a POINTER just
*> set below 1.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PTRLOW.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  WS-LINE             PIC X(40).
01  WS-PART             PIC X(10).
01  WS-PTR              PIC S99.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    *> Reported: MOVE 0, INITIALIZE, and COMPUTE to a negative number.
    MOVE 0 TO WS-PTR
    STRING "A" DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-LINE WITH POINTER WS-PTR
    INITIALIZE WS-PTR
    UNSTRING WS-LINE DELIMITED BY SPACE INTO WS-PART
        WITH POINTER WS-PTR
    COMPUTE WS-PTR = -1
    STRING "B" DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-LINE POINTER WS-PTR
    *> Not reported: set to 1, moved on in between, and a PERFORM in
    *> between that may set it.
    MOVE 1 TO WS-PTR
    STRING "C" DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-LINE WITH POINTER WS-PTR
    MOVE 0 TO WS-PTR
    ADD 1 TO WS-PTR
    STRING "D" DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-LINE WITH POINTER WS-PTR
    MOVE 0 TO WS-PTR
    PERFORM SET-POINTER
    STRING "E" DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-LINE WITH POINTER WS-PTR
    GOBACK.
SET-POINTER.
    MOVE 1 TO WS-PTR.
